'''Bats''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that is currently obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2024]].

==Appearance==
It has a purple blade which has a lighter purple colour on the tip that fades into a darker purple closer to the guard, as well as silhouettes of bats on the blade, hence the name.

==Trivia==

*It has a [[Bats Gun (2024)|partner gun]] under the same name.

